# ⚠️ IMPORTANT: 
# For LOCAL MODEL to work on production, you MUST:
# 1. Deploy your backend server to Render/Railway/Fly.io
# 2. Update VITE_BACKEND_URL above with the deployed backend URL
# 3. Set this environment variable in Vercel Dashboard
# 4. The backend needs Python + pandas installed (Render/Railway support this)

# ==========================================
